OL,3,GNEWSAMan held over alleged hit-and-run
OL,4,Aafter collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after two men
OL,7,Fwere hurt in an alleged hit-and-run
OL,8,Fafter getting out of their car
OL,9,Ffollowing a collision.
OL,11,FA man in his 50s was struck by a car on
OL,12,FBroughton Lane in Salford at about
OL,13,F17:40 BST on Wednesday, Greater
OL,14,FManchester Police said.
OL,16,FHe has been left with life-changing
OL,17,Finjuries. An 18-year-old man was also
OL,18,Fhurt after being "dragged along" with
OL,19,Fthe vehicle and both men remain in
OL,20,Fhospital, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
